  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Blood; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp (least), 8,000 gp (lesser), 16,000 gp (greater); <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nCreatures with the Reservoir feat may spend a full-round action filling this flask with stolen blood, transferring blood points into the flask. The quality of the flask determines how many points it may hold: least - 2, lesser - 4, greater - 6. Reservoir points do not expire while in the crimson flask. A creature possessing the flask may open it as a move action. While holding an open flask, the holder may spend reservoir points as if those points were in its reserve.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Blood sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp (least), 4,000 gp (lesser), 8,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
